<title>USA: Cylone Justin to strengthen again in Coral Sea - WSC.</title>
<headline>Cylone Justin to strengthen again in Coral Sea - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Justin, with 85 mph winds, is in the Coral Sea southeast of New Guinea and well to the east of Queensland, Australia, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Justin is expected to strengthen as it drifts west then moves southwest and it will become a strong risk to shipping in the eastern Coral Sea, WSC added.</p>
</text>
